Quick Sort says: "Put one element in its correct position first, then divide."

Quick Sort is asked much more frequently in interviews because it is:

Faster on average than Merge Sort.
An in-place sorting algorithm (doesn't need an extra array like Merge Sort).
Based on a very clever idea called Partitioning.

